 "Lacy BE et al. ACG Clinical Guideline: Management of Irritable Bowel Syndrome. Am J Gastroenterol 2021;116(1):17-44.": "Lacy BE et al. ACG Clinical Guideline: Management of Irritable Bowel Syndrome. Am J Gastroenterol 2021;116(1):17-44.",
 "Named in the AAN and AHS guideline on preventing migraine, where the amounts studied were supplements far above what food gives.": "Nombrados en la guía de la AAN y la AHS sobre prevención de migraña, donde las cantidades estudiadas eran suplementos muy por encima de lo que da la comida.",
 "Holland S et al. Evidence-based guideline update: NSAIDs and other complementary treatments for episodic migraine prevention in adults. Neurology 2012;78(17):1346-1353.": "Holland S et al. Evidence-based guideline update: NSAIDs and other complementary treatments for episodic migraine prevention in adults. Neurology 2012;78(17):1346-1353.",
 "Prostate Health (BPH & Prostate Cancer Risk)": "Salud de la próstata (HPB y riesgo de cáncer de próstata)",
 "Prostate tissue holds more zinc than any other tissue. The evidence is from laboratory and population studies, not trials.": "El tejido de la próstata guarda más zinc que cualquier otro tejido. La evidencia viene de estudios de laboratorio y de población, no de ensayos.",
 "Chemoprevention of Prostate Cancer by Natural Agents: Evidence from Molecular and Epidemiological Studies. Anticancer Res 2019;39(10):5231.": "Chemoprevention of Prostate Cancer by Natural Agents: Evidence from Molecular and Epidemiological Studies. Anticancer Res 2019;39(10):5231.",
 "Gout is shaped mostly by purines, alcohol and sugary drinks, and the gauges count none of those, so nothing is grouped here.": "La gota depende sobre todo de las purinas, el alcohol y las bebidas azucaradas, y los medidores no cuentan ninguno de esos, así que aquí no se agrupa nada.",
